THIS IS NOT AN OPEN-SOURCE LICENCE.

This file exists to state the terms explicitly. A repository with no LICENSE is
already governed by copyright's default of all-rights-reserved, which is the
intended position here — but "no file" and "deliberately closed" look identical
to a reader, and only one of them is true. An institution's counsel asks this
question early, and the answer should not have to be inferred.


